[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    19[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   rejection/fallback branches**: an input is rejected and a documented default or
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    20[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   backup value is substituted instead.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    21[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * The only rejecting function is `parse_env_numeric` (3 rejection branches, each
