[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    27[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * The only size constant is `BUFFER_SIZE 256`; the only magic values are
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    28[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   `03`, `0755`, `0x0F`, `0100`, `012`.
