[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    15[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | `PROG_VERBOSE`     | `init_config_from_env` | `flags.verbose` → `<<1` in `apply_bit_operations`, plus 6 `printf` sites | absent / present-without-`'1'` / present-containing-`'1'` (test is `strchr(v,'1')`, **not** equality, so `"a1b"` and `"31"` count) |
